// The WORLD plan: the server derives its multi-world layout from this
// plus the zone kinds — every town/map zone runs as ONE shared world;
// each roster idler gets a private instance of the entry story zone.
// Other story zones (and, later, atlas map instances) are created on
// demand. Per-world seeds are key-derived (base_seed ^ fnv1a64(key)).
WorldDef(
    idlers: ["Kargan", "Veles", "Mirra"],
    entry_zone: "withered_shore",
)
